    "focused_test_conclusion": "passed on Ubuntu, macOS, and Windows",
    "behavior": "The test first resolves and renders Attachments/photo.png and opens the note source preview, then renames the image outside OpenObsidian to Attachments/renamed-photo.png. Refresh keeps the vault and note active, clears stale report/preview/error/texture state, and preserves both exact post-rename vault and separate app-data snapshots. Fresh resolution leaves the original embed unresolved and NotRendered rather than redirecting it to the renamed path. Both snapshots remain unchanged through UI teardown.",
